WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:13.670 --> 00:15.410
Ying, look.

4
00:18.070 --> 00:19.450
Ying, eat up.

5
00:19.480 --> 00:20.610
It's very sweet.

6
00:21.960 --> 00:23.620
Ever since I was a child, I knew

7
00:23.830 --> 00:25.020
that in this family,

8
00:25.120 --> 00:26.280
my sister needed to be favored

9
00:26.280 --> 00:27.220
more than I did.

10
00:29.920 --> 00:31.320
But she always felt

11
00:31.640 --> 00:32.670
that she was taking away

12
00:32.670 --> 00:35.000
the love our parents should have given me.

13
00:35.520 --> 00:36.390
Give it to us.

14
00:36.420 --> 00:37.350
-So... -Give it to us.

15
00:37.350 --> 00:38.960
she lived her life as an umbrella

16
00:38.960 --> 00:40.920
to shelter me from the wind and rain,

17
00:40.920 --> 00:42.210
making sure I got twice

18
00:42.320 --> 00:44.590
as much of all the good things.

19
00:44.840 --> 00:45.840
This is my brother.

20
00:45.840 --> 00:47.360
If any of you dare to bully him again,

21
00:47.360 --> 00:48.890
I won't let you off!

22
00:49.110 --> 00:50.520
All these years, she has been

23
00:50.520 --> 00:52.110
protecting me.

24
00:52.240 --> 00:54.640
Now I also want to be

25
00:54.640 --> 00:56.350
the one who can protect her.

26
02:23.960 --> 02:28.740
[Light the Dark]

27
02:29.180 --> 02:31.890
[Episode 6]

28
02:51.360 --> 02:51.960
Ying.

29
02:52.430 --> 02:53.430
The food is ready.

30
02:55.210 --> 02:55.900
Coming.

31
02:56.360 --> 02:57.690
Bring them to the table.

32
03:02.590 --> 03:03.360
Here.

33
03:05.310 --> 03:06.700
Where is your stool?

34
03:08.680 --> 03:09.610
I'm happy today.

35
03:09.870 --> 03:10.790
We can have a drink

36
03:10.790 --> 03:11.800
with Mom and Dad.

37
03:21.970 --> 03:23.390
Don't pour too much.

38
03:34.400 --> 03:34.910
Here.

39
03:42.430 --> 03:44.680
Dad, Mom.

40
03:45.120 --> 03:46.720
Wan Yang committed suicide.

41
03:46.960 --> 03:48.560
The evil forces have fallen.

42
03:49.480 --> 03:50.760
Today, my sister and I

43
03:51.579 --> 03:52.880
can finally hold our heads high

44
03:52.880 --> 03:54.210
and raise a glass to you.

45
03:55.030 --> 03:55.980
Shan.

46
03:56.560 --> 03:57.360
Promise me.

47
03:57.470 --> 03:59.590
Don't talk about these things anymore.

48
03:59.590 --> 04:01.050
Everything is in the past.

49
04:01.120 --> 04:02.000
The two of us

50
04:02.560 --> 04:03.890
just need to look ahead.

51
04:04.710 --> 04:05.750
I haven't told you yet,

52
04:05.750 --> 04:06.430
Dad, Mom.

53
04:07.360 --> 04:10.410
My sister has left the plant now.

54
04:10.560 --> 04:12.360
Whether she can go back or not,

55
04:12.680 --> 04:13.470
you two

56
04:13.910 --> 04:15.430
must bless her

57
04:16.000 --> 04:16.829
so her path ahead

58
04:16.829 --> 04:17.829
will be smoother.

59
04:17.829 --> 04:18.490
Bottoms up.

60
04:19.070 --> 04:20.440
What are you doing?

61
04:21.480 --> 04:22.720
Don't just ask them to bless me.

62
04:22.720 --> 04:24.870
Tell them to bless both of us.

63
04:25.120 --> 04:25.920
Hurry up and try it.

64
04:25.920 --> 04:27.240
See if the food is good.

65
04:27.830 --> 04:29.000
It must be good.

66
04:29.190 --> 04:31.840
My brother's cooking is great now.

67
04:39.360 --> 04:41.290
I suddenly remembered something.

68
04:41.870 --> 04:43.270
Do you remember when we were kids

69
04:43.270 --> 04:45.750
and the power went out? I was afraid of the dark.

70
04:45.750 --> 04:47.550
How did you comfort me back then?

71
04:51.360 --> 04:52.860
I said...

72
04:53.120 --> 04:54.220
You're the little man

73
04:54.220 --> 04:55.070
of our family.

74
04:55.720 --> 04:57.790
How can you be so timid?

75
04:58.560 --> 05:00.240
When you grow up...

76
05:00.310 --> 05:02.240
You'll have to protect Mom and Dad,

77
05:02.360 --> 05:03.510
and me, too.

78
05:04.270 --> 05:05.510
Besides that,

79
05:05.510 --> 05:07.040
you told me something else.

80
05:07.950 --> 05:09.120
You told me

81
05:10.120 --> 05:12.240
that darkness never lasts forever.

82
05:12.240 --> 05:13.510
Even when there's no light,

83
05:13.510 --> 05:14.910
there's always a candle.

84
05:15.480 --> 05:16.940
And if the candle goes out,

85
05:17.270 --> 05:19.270
the sun will rise eventually.

86
05:20.510 --> 05:21.550
Dawn

87
05:22.310 --> 05:23.950
will light up everything.

88
05:28.240 --> 05:30.000
As long as there's light in your heart,

89
05:30.000 --> 05:31.690
you can light up the darkness.

90
05:33.510 --> 05:35.640
As long as there's light in your heart,

91
05:37.159 --> 05:38.820
you can light up the darkness.

92
05:40.000 --> 05:41.600
Face whatever comes your way

93
05:42.920 --> 05:45.850
-And keep moving forward. -and keep moving forward.

94
05:46.950 --> 05:47.750
Ying.

95
05:48.950 --> 05:50.610
Let me ask you something then.

96
05:51.390 --> 05:52.770
Do you really think

97
05:54.159 --> 05:55.950
a candle can light up the dark?

98
05:57.350 --> 05:58.240
Can we really

99
05:59.159 --> 06:00.110
overcome every obstacle

100
06:00.110 --> 06:01.320
in this world?

101
06:09.310 --> 06:10.560
Stop drinking.

102
06:10.720 --> 06:12.270
I think you're drunk.

103
06:12.410 --> 06:14.340
You're starting to talk nonsense.

104
06:14.650 --> 06:15.650
No more drinking.

105
06:15.680 --> 06:16.630
Eat something.

106
06:16.920 --> 06:17.720
Ying.

107
06:19.680 --> 06:20.630
Promise me.

108
06:21.070 --> 06:23.170
No matter what happens in the future,

109
06:23.830 --> 06:25.490
I will always be your brother.

110
06:29.160 --> 06:30.270
Silly, silly, silly.

111
06:30.270 --> 06:32.150
I don't know what you're thinking.

112
06:32.150 --> 06:34.430
Come on, eat up.

113
06:34.430 --> 06:35.430
No more drinking.

114
06:35.430 --> 06:36.430
Hurry up!

115
06:37.680 --> 06:38.960
No more drinking.

116
06:41.040 --> 06:41.900
Just one glass.

117
06:43.159 --> 06:44.390
Drink one with me.

118
06:46.630 --> 06:47.960
You're so disobedient.

119
06:48.600 --> 06:50.220
After this one, no more drinking.

120
06:50.220 --> 06:51.930
You need to help me tomorrow.

121
06:52.040 --> 06:52.920
To my sister!

122
06:54.240 --> 06:55.690
To my brother.

123
07:02.330 --> 07:03.580
[A Warm Send-Off for the Investigation Team]

124
07:02.510 --> 07:04.510
I will definitely support his work.

125
07:04.830 --> 07:05.830
Stop messing around!

126
07:05.830 --> 07:06.920
Make way! Make way!

127
07:06.920 --> 07:08.070
Come on! Make way!

128
07:08.190 --> 07:08.830
Make way! Make way!

129
07:08.830 --> 07:09.750
Make way! Make way!

130
07:09.750 --> 07:10.190
Make way! Make way!

131
07:10.190 --> 07:10.790
Applause!

132
07:21.270 --> 07:23.400
The investigation team is going back.

133
07:24.160 --> 07:24.680
Don't forget

134
07:24.680 --> 07:26.750
what you promised me last night, Ying.

135
07:26.750 --> 07:28.410
I will always be your brother.

136
07:29.800 --> 07:31.530
Keep up the good work. Goodbye.

137
07:31.560 --> 07:32.490
Team Leader Pan.

138
07:33.040 --> 07:34.750
-What are you doing? The leaders are talking. -What are you doing?

139
07:34.750 --> 07:35.240
Don't go forward.

140
07:35.240 --> 07:36.240
-Team Leader Pan! Team Leader Pan! -Don't go forward!

141
07:36.240 --> 07:37.040
What are you doing?

142
07:37.040 --> 07:38.190
I am Chen Fu's son!

143
07:38.190 --> 07:39.650
Don't stop him. Let him in.

144
07:42.830 --> 07:43.760
Team Leader Pan.

145
07:43.920 --> 07:45.190
I am the son of Chen Fu,

146
07:45.190 --> 07:47.000
who died in the line of duty in the recent explosion.

147
07:47.000 --> 07:48.680
My name is Chen Shan.

148
07:49.360 --> 07:50.620
Nice to meet you, Chen.

149
07:50.720 --> 07:51.650
Nice to meet you.

150
07:51.800 --> 07:53.600
I want to thank the investigation team

151
07:53.600 --> 07:54.240
for your continued

152
07:54.240 --> 07:56.040
help and support for our family.

153
07:56.680 --> 07:58.000
It's what we should do.

154
07:58.560 --> 07:59.240
Today,

155
07:59.240 --> 08:01.570
there's something else I want to tell you.

156
08:04.160 --> 08:05.690
I want to report something!

157
08:05.830 --> 08:06.630
Report?

158
08:06.630 --> 08:07.510
Report?

159
08:11.680 --> 08:13.140
My mother, Zhang Wenying,

160
08:13.190 --> 08:14.750
wasn't withholding information

161
08:14.750 --> 08:16.360
about Wan Yang's corruption case.

162
08:16.360 --> 08:18.690
She was coerced by Wan Yang for a long time!

163
08:19.040 --> 08:19.600
How did he...

164
08:19.600 --> 08:20.190
Chen.

165
08:20.680 --> 08:21.880
How did he coerce her?

166
08:22.920 --> 08:24.180
More than 20 years ago,

167
08:24.240 --> 08:25.360
a mistake in the blueprints

168
08:25.360 --> 08:26.830
designed by my mother, Zhang Wenying,

169
08:26.830 --> 08:28.430
led to an explosion at a construction site,

170
08:28.430 --> 08:29.920
killing my sister Chen Ying's

171
08:29.920 --> 08:31.120
biological parents.

172
08:31.560 --> 08:33.080
I've heard about this before.

173
08:33.080 --> 08:34.179
Back then, Wan Yang

174
08:34.320 --> 08:35.669
covered up the incident

175
08:35.669 --> 08:37.240
and classified it as an accident,

176
08:37.240 --> 08:38.720
saving my mother from punishment.

177
08:38.720 --> 08:40.440
From then on, my mother, Zhang Wenying,

178
08:40.440 --> 08:41.380
had to do

179
08:41.400 --> 08:42.630
whatever he said.

180
08:45.910 --> 08:47.910
Team Leader Pan, please take a look.

181
08:48.320 --> 08:49.930
This is the real investigation report

182
08:49.030 --> 08:49.940
[Liability Determination Report]

183
08:50.270 --> 08:51.720
on that accident.

184
08:51.840 --> 08:52.910
My sister Chen Ying

185
08:52.960 --> 08:54.750
was originally named Peng Xiaoyun.

186
08:54.750 --> 08:56.540
Her biological father was Peng Da,

187
08:56.540 --> 08:58.080
and her biological mother was Feng Lan.

188
08:58.080 --> 09:00.510
In 1978, they were killed in an explosion

189
09:00.510 --> 09:02.120
during a mountain blasting operation

190
09:02.120 --> 09:03.270
for a geological survey in the Gobi Desert.

191
09:03.270 --> 09:04.330
After that,

192
09:04.480 --> 09:06.000
my parents adopted her

193
09:06.390 --> 09:07.850
and renamed her Chen Ying.

194
09:08.270 --> 09:09.670
By rights, she should be recognized

195
09:09.670 --> 09:11.150
as a family member of employees

196
09:11.150 --> 09:12.270
who died in the line of duty.

197
09:12.270 --> 09:13.150
She shouldn't be implicated

198
09:13.150 --> 09:14.480
because of my mother,

199
09:14.480 --> 09:15.270
Zhang Wenying.

200
09:15.270 --> 09:16.360
It's not fair!

201
09:16.360 --> 09:17.880
Yes, it's not fair!

202
09:17.960 --> 09:18.970
Team Leader Pan.

203
09:19.270 --> 09:20.790
Everyone knows how capable

204
09:20.790 --> 09:22.620
my sister Chen Ying

205
09:22.650 --> 09:23.640
is at work!

206
09:23.670 --> 09:25.930
The plant shouldn't have dismissed her!

207
09:27.000 --> 09:28.110
And her

208
09:28.130 --> 09:29.260
biological parents

209
09:29.270 --> 09:30.810
died in the line of duty.

210
09:31.270 --> 09:32.910
So shouldn't the plant, by rights,

211
09:32.910 --> 09:34.480
give the house to her

212
09:34.480 --> 09:36.000
as compensation,

213
09:36.120 --> 09:37.200
instead of taking it back

214
09:37.200 --> 09:38.530
like they're doing now?

215
09:38.630 --> 09:39.750
Don't you all agree?

216
09:39.750 --> 09:40.320
Yes!

217
09:42.320 --> 09:43.270
It should be returned to her!

218
09:43.270 --> 09:43.960
Chen,

219
09:44.270 --> 09:45.150
since this is the case,

220
09:45.150 --> 09:46.750
let's go inside

221
09:47.120 --> 09:48.750
and talk about it in detail.

222
09:49.550 --> 09:50.270
Okay.

223
09:50.910 --> 09:52.080
Come on! Make way!

224
09:54.840 --> 09:55.790
Move along!

225
11:48.240 --> 11:49.030
Mr. Qi.

226
11:54.670 --> 11:56.130
I'll go in first by myself.

227
12:14.320 --> 12:15.120
You're back?

228
12:15.910 --> 12:17.510
One more dish and we can eat.

229
12:28.200 --> 12:29.000
Ying.

230
12:29.870 --> 12:30.630
The investigation team

231
12:30.630 --> 12:31.790
has already agreed.

232
12:32.670 --> 12:35.000
You can be removed from our family register

233
12:35.000 --> 12:36.550
and then registered as a family member

234
12:36.550 --> 12:38.270
of employees who died in the line of duty.

235
12:38.270 --> 12:38.960
Then you can

236
12:38.960 --> 12:40.000
keep the current house

237
12:40.000 --> 12:41.510
and your job

238
12:41.840 --> 12:42.960
as Peng Xiaoyun.

239
12:43.510 --> 12:44.240
You will have a

240
12:44.240 --> 12:45.440
very good future.

241
12:54.200 --> 12:55.000
Time to eat.

242
13:07.840 --> 13:09.640
Why are you standing there? Eat.

243
13:34.550 --> 13:37.010
The day I tracked down Wan Yang's warehouse,

244
13:38.360 --> 13:40.470
he was waiting for me downstairs.

245
13:42.390 --> 13:44.630
He gave me the documents about what happened

246
13:44.630 --> 13:46.630
to your biological parents.

247
13:46.870 --> 13:48.480
I didn't believe it at the time,

248
13:48.480 --> 13:50.280
so I rushed home to confront Mom.

249
13:53.790 --> 13:54.850
She didn't deny it.

250
13:57.480 --> 13:58.240
Ever since then,

251
13:58.240 --> 14:01.040
every time you mentioned investigating Wan Yang,

252
14:01.320 --> 14:02.790
I'd get nervous.

253
14:04.200 --> 14:05.600
I wanted to investigate,

254
14:05.750 --> 14:06.920
but I was even more afraid that Wan Yang

255
14:06.920 --> 14:08.490
would tell you everything.

256
14:08.550 --> 14:09.440
I forgot to add salt.

257
14:09.440 --> 14:10.080
Ying.

258
14:10.510 --> 14:11.360
Ying.

259
14:15.750 --> 14:17.150
Can you say something?

260
14:25.870 --> 14:27.270
Mom and Dad are both gone.

261
14:28.510 --> 14:29.770
You're all I have left.

262
14:34.320 --> 14:36.320
I really don't want to see you

263
14:36.390 --> 14:37.600
get implicated

264
14:37.600 --> 14:38.600
because of them.

265
14:39.480 --> 14:40.320
I don't want to see you

266
14:40.320 --> 14:41.390
suffer every day over things

267
14:41.390 --> 14:43.450
you never should have had to bear.

268
14:43.670 --> 14:45.320
You know how I feel

269
14:46.080 --> 14:47.120
every time I see you

270
14:47.120 --> 14:48.200
pretending everything's fine,

271
14:48.200 --> 14:49.860
forcing a smile in front of me?

272
14:50.390 --> 14:51.630
I can't stand it.

273
14:53.120 --> 14:54.510
I really can't.

274
14:55.120 --> 14:56.920
I want you to be okay.

275
14:57.150 --> 14:59.960
I want you to have a good future.

276
15:00.000 --> 15:00.790
I want you

277
15:00.790 --> 15:02.550
to have at least a normal life.

278
15:02.550 --> 15:04.220
All I want is for you to be okay!

279
15:14.440 --> 15:15.360
Look at them.

280
15:17.320 --> 15:18.150
They are the people

281
15:18.150 --> 15:20.410
I've called Mom and Dad for over 20 years.

282
15:20.870 --> 15:21.630
They gave me

283
15:21.630 --> 15:22.960
a happy home.

284
15:23.000 --> 15:24.120
They're the people

285
15:24.150 --> 15:25.750
I've loved for over 20 years!

286
15:29.030 --> 15:30.490
And what are you doing now?

287
15:32.510 --> 15:34.550
You're tearing my life apart.

288
15:35.960 --> 15:36.750
You're tearing apart the life

289
15:36.750 --> 15:38.750
I've lived for over 20 years!

290
15:41.000 --> 15:42.320
Now tell me.

291
15:42.960 --> 15:43.960
Who are they?

292
15:45.150 --> 15:45.960
Who are they?

293
15:47.390 --> 15:48.650
Are they the people who gave me happiness

294
15:48.650 --> 15:50.850
or the people who brought me suffering?

295
15:52.270 --> 15:54.150
You knew all this long ago.

296
15:55.440 --> 15:57.200
Why didn't you tell me earlier

297
15:58.670 --> 16:00.080
so I could've seen you for what you really are

298
16:00.080 --> 16:01.350
and stayed away from you?

299
16:01.350 --> 16:02.750
Why did you suddenly come forward

300
16:02.750 --> 16:04.150
and say all this now?

301
16:04.510 --> 16:05.630
I have no parents,

302
16:05.630 --> 16:06.630
no job, no future.

303
16:06.630 --> 16:08.150
I can only make a living by selling socks.

304
16:08.150 --> 16:09.080
You despise me.

305
16:09.080 --> 16:10.720
You think I'm useless

306
16:10.720 --> 16:12.720
and an embarrassment to you, right?

307
16:12.960 --> 16:13.630
Fine.

308
16:13.960 --> 16:14.750
Leave.

309
16:15.240 --> 16:16.690
Leave here.

310
16:18.710 --> 16:19.630
Go to Guangzhou

311
16:19.650 --> 16:21.010
and be an engineer!

312
16:22.150 --> 16:22.870
Get out!

313
16:23.270 --> 16:24.190
Get out!

314
17:55.440 --> 17:57.500
I didn't want to face all this either.

315
18:00.380 --> 18:01.750
But it's all true.

316
18:05.400 --> 18:07.720
I had a big fight with Mom that day.

317
18:12.720 --> 18:14.160
Mom died because of me.

318
18:21.790 --> 18:23.070
Chen Shan. Wait.

319
18:23.090 --> 18:23.720
What...

320
18:24.000 --> 18:25.280
What are you doing?

321
18:25.300 --> 18:25.960
Come on.

322
18:25.960 --> 18:27.540
Talk to your sister.

323
18:28.830 --> 18:29.480
Well...

324
18:32.400 --> 18:33.760
Well... Chen Shan...

325
18:35.480 --> 18:36.270
Chen Shan.

326
18:36.750 --> 18:37.750
Chen Shan!

327
18:37.880 --> 18:40.210
Chen Shan, where are you going? Chen Shan!

328
19:10.000 --> 19:11.400
To be honest with you,

329
19:13.680 --> 19:14.680
in my heart,

330
19:16.310 --> 19:17.920
I really feel that no one in this world

331
19:17.920 --> 19:19.250
is good enough for Ying,

332
19:21.240 --> 19:22.240
including you.

333
19:24.270 --> 19:26.200
But there are no other options now.

334
19:28.070 --> 19:29.790
You're all she has left now.

335
19:35.030 --> 19:37.090
When I'm not around her in the future,

336
19:38.000 --> 19:39.800
please spend more time with her.

337
19:46.000 --> 19:47.800
Can you promise me one thing, Mo?

338
19:50.400 --> 19:51.310
From now on, you must

339
19:51.310 --> 19:52.550
take good care of her.

340
19:54.550 --> 19:55.440
I don't want her to

341
19:55.440 --> 19:57.100
be treated unfairly anymore.

342
19:59.200 --> 20:00.400
Not even a little bit.

343
20:02.790 --> 20:03.590
Okay?

344
20:13.480 --> 20:14.270
Chen Shan.

345
20:15.720 --> 20:16.590
I understand

346
20:18.000 --> 20:19.130
what you're saying.

347
20:20.920 --> 20:21.960
From now on,

348
20:22.640 --> 20:23.720
we are family.

349
20:26.110 --> 20:27.770
Let's have a bottle of baijiu.

350
20:49.350 --> 20:50.440
Get me that

351
20:50.440 --> 20:51.350
Laobaigan.

352
20:51.350 --> 20:52.160
Okay.

353
21:29.480 --> 21:30.270
Chen Ying.

354
21:33.680 --> 21:35.290
Why are you drinking?

355
21:54.200 --> 21:55.350
This watch

356
21:59.200 --> 22:00.930
was a gift from the Chen family.

357
22:03.440 --> 22:04.700
Thank you, Mom and Dad.

358
22:05.200 --> 22:06.000
From now on,

359
22:07.510 --> 22:08.830
I'll wear this watch.

360
22:10.640 --> 22:12.070
They wanted to tell me

361
22:16.830 --> 22:19.230
that I was the Chen family's real daughter.

362
22:21.510 --> 22:22.310
But...

363
22:25.440 --> 22:27.400
what does this even mean?

364
22:29.400 --> 22:30.680
Did they really cause

365
22:30.680 --> 22:32.790
my real parents' deaths?

366
22:35.960 --> 22:37.200
Did they really use

367
22:37.200 --> 22:39.730
the same hands that killed my parents to weave

368
22:40.270 --> 22:43.150
a web of lies and make me believe I was happy?

369
22:43.790 --> 22:45.400
Then who am I?

370
22:47.440 --> 22:49.000
I am... I am...

371
22:49.000 --> 22:51.030
Am I the daughter of the victims,

372
22:51.030 --> 22:53.640
or am I the child of the killers?

373
23:04.750 --> 23:07.010
They are all dead.

374
23:08.270 --> 23:10.240
I don't even know what happened.

375
23:10.240 --> 23:11.750
What really happened?

376
23:11.750 --> 23:14.130
Who can tell me the truth?

377
23:19.000 --> 23:19.940
Chen Ying.

378
23:23.200 --> 23:24.000
Ying.

379
23:25.900 --> 23:26.930
Qi Mo...

380
23:29.640 --> 23:30.680
Qi Mo...

381
23:31.480 --> 23:32.920
Take me away.

382
23:34.350 --> 23:35.440
Take me away.

383
23:36.350 --> 23:38.770
Take me away from here, okay?

384
23:39.880 --> 23:41.690
Take me away from here.

385
23:43.270 --> 23:46.400
Take me away from here, okay?

386
23:54.200 --> 23:56.830
Take me away from here.

387
24:18.960 --> 24:19.750
Shan.

388
24:20.000 --> 24:21.480
Yiming. Auntie.

389
24:21.790 --> 24:22.590
Shan?

390
24:23.720 --> 24:25.110
It's so late. What are you...

391
24:25.110 --> 24:25.920
Can I...

392
24:27.440 --> 24:28.830
stay here...

393
24:28.960 --> 24:29.760
for a few days?

394
24:30.550 --> 24:32.420
Just a few days. I'll leave soon.

395
24:32.470 --> 24:33.880
What are you talking about?

396
24:33.880 --> 24:34.720
Of course you can.

397
24:34.720 --> 24:35.310
Yeah.

398
24:35.310 --> 24:37.080
Stay as long as you want.

399
24:37.240 --> 24:37.790
Thank you, Auntie.

400
24:37.790 --> 24:39.030
We have a folding bed.

401
24:39.200 --> 24:40.510
You two can share a room.

402
24:40.510 --> 24:41.680
-No problem. -Hurry up and tidy things up.

403
24:41.680 --> 24:43.340
I'll go tidy things up for you.

404
24:43.790 --> 24:44.640
Shan, you...

405
24:44.640 --> 24:46.030
As long as you don't mind our house,

406
24:46.030 --> 24:47.760
you can stay as long as you want.

407
24:48.350 --> 24:50.210
Where did you get the motorcycle?

408
24:50.960 --> 24:52.030
You mean this one?

409
24:52.680 --> 24:54.880
Lu went to work in Shenzhen,

410
24:54.960 --> 24:55.830
so he asked me to help him

411
24:55.830 --> 24:57.270
look after this motorcycle.

412
24:57.270 --> 24:58.880
Shan, if you're free,

413
24:58.960 --> 25:00.610
let's go for a ride, shall we?

414
25:03.200 --> 25:04.000
Never mind.

415
25:06.160 --> 25:08.270
Actually, about what happened at the plant gate today,

416
25:08.270 --> 25:09.440
I heard about it.

417
25:09.830 --> 25:11.440
Did you have a fight with Ying

418
25:11.640 --> 25:12.750
and get kicked out?

419
25:15.000 --> 25:15.920
I'm fine.

420
25:21.400 --> 25:23.130
What's important is my sister.

421
25:24.680 --> 25:26.880
She must be feeling terrible right now.

422
25:39.790 --> 25:40.550
Xiaoyun.

423
25:42.240 --> 25:43.880
This is your father's watch

424
25:43.900 --> 25:45.900
that we found at the accident scene.

425
26:40.550 --> 26:43.000
I've been thinking about something all night,

426
26:43.000 --> 26:44.110
and I must tell you.

427
26:45.000 --> 26:46.200
You may not know this,

428
26:47.830 --> 26:49.450
but the first time I saw you

429
26:49.470 --> 26:50.600
in Master's office,

430
26:51.350 --> 26:52.350
you smiled at me,

431
26:53.920 --> 26:55.270
and it was like the sun

432
26:56.270 --> 26:57.680
had lit up my life.

433
26:59.830 --> 27:01.830
I want to take care of you from now on.

434
27:02.880 --> 27:03.720
Rest assured.

435
27:04.590 --> 27:05.750
If you're with me,

436
27:07.200 --> 27:08.880
you won't have to do any work

437
27:09.590 --> 27:11.240
or wait on me.

438
27:11.240 --> 27:12.770
I'll always treat you well.

439
27:17.240 --> 27:18.480
I made this for you...

440
27:19.830 --> 27:21.070
in a hurry.

441
27:23.000 --> 27:24.270
When we get married,

442
27:26.350 --> 27:27.880
I'll give you a real one.

443
27:29.790 --> 27:30.880
Will you marry me?

444
27:31.840 --> 27:34.090
♪ You guess, I guess ♪

445
27:34.190 --> 27:36.370
♪ You say, I say ♪

446
27:36.480 --> 27:39.780
♪ Longing can consume us ♪

447
27:39.800 --> 27:42.140
♪ No asking, no crying ♪

448
27:42.160 --> 27:44.210
♪ No thinking, no speaking ♪

449
27:44.300 --> 27:48.170
♪ The haze slowly clears away ♪

450
27:48.210 --> 27:50.830
♪ Being wild, acting spoiled ♪

451
27:50.850 --> 27:52.630
♪ Unchanged, undefeated ♪

452
27:52.740 --> 27:56.180
♪ Growing up starts right now ♪

453
27:56.360 --> 27:58.370
♪ Don't look back ♪

454
27:58.480 --> 28:00.500
♪ You see, I see ♪

455
28:00.800 --> 28:04.160
♪ The sun is rising ♪

456
28:03.790 --> 28:04.590
Ying.

457
28:05.160 --> 28:06.420
No one understands you

458
28:07.440 --> 28:09.070
better than I do right now.

459
28:12.720 --> 28:14.120
Master was a good person.

460
28:15.030 --> 28:16.310
So was Mr. Chen.

461
28:17.920 --> 28:18.880
I don't

462
28:19.510 --> 28:20.510
understand

463
28:20.640 --> 28:23.830
♪ Your smile is so beautiful ♪

464
28:21.440 --> 28:23.030
why they lied to you.

465
28:24.610 --> 28:28.480
♪ It guards the beat of my heart ♪

466
28:24.920 --> 28:25.880
Don't you want to know

467
28:25.880 --> 28:27.160
the truth?

468
28:28.640 --> 28:33.080
♪ Time keeps running on ♪

469
28:31.550 --> 28:32.350
Ying,

470
28:33.230 --> 28:36.750
♪ Your arms are soft and warm ♪

471
28:33.510 --> 28:35.320
you told me last night

472
28:35.640 --> 28:36.880
that you wanted to leave here.

473
28:36.850 --> 28:41.360
♪ I see the stars smiling ♪

474
28:39.590 --> 28:40.850
But we can't leave now.

475
28:41.490 --> 28:44.970
♪ I hear the wind playfully sigh ♪

476
28:42.480 --> 28:43.340
Think about it.

477
28:45.240 --> 28:46.640
I'm the plant director now.

478
28:45.660 --> 28:49.190
♪ Time is still burning bright ♪

479
28:48.400 --> 28:49.440
I have a chance to help you

480
28:49.420 --> 28:58.250
♪ Lighting up the lonely souls in this world ♪

481
28:49.440 --> 28:50.880
uncover the truth.

482
28:54.030 --> 28:55.750
You can find out

483
28:56.550 --> 28:57.550
what really caused

484
28:57.550 --> 28:59.480
your biological parents' deaths.

485
29:04.880 --> 29:05.640
Ying.

486
29:07.590 --> 29:08.880
If we leave now,

487
29:10.750 --> 29:12.550
we may never get another chance.

488
29:36.110 --> 29:38.690
[Marriage Registration Office]

489
29:39.840 --> 29:42.260
[Name: Peng Xiaoyun]

490
29:46.400 --> 29:48.160
After discussing the matter, the plant leadership

491
29:48.160 --> 29:49.550
has decided that, since your sister's biological parents

492
29:49.550 --> 29:50.680
died in the line of duty,

493
29:50.680 --> 29:51.550
the plant

494
29:52.200 --> 29:53.630
will allocate this house to her

495
29:53.630 --> 29:54.670
as compensation.

496
29:55.270 --> 29:57.530
Your sister has decided to give the house

497
29:57.680 --> 29:58.640
to you instead,

498
29:58.790 --> 30:01.550
as a way of repaying the Chen family

499
30:01.640 --> 30:02.920
for raising her.

500
30:03.640 --> 30:04.790
When the time comes,

501
30:04.920 --> 30:06.160
you can move back in.

502
30:10.510 --> 30:12.030
Then can my sister...

503
30:13.550 --> 30:14.350
k-keep her job

504
30:14.350 --> 30:15.590
at the plant?

505
30:16.030 --> 30:16.830
Of course.

506
30:17.440 --> 30:18.240
The paperwork for her return

507
30:18.240 --> 30:19.310
is already being processed.

508
30:19.310 --> 30:20.200
Once it's done,

509
30:20.510 --> 30:21.770
she can go back to work.

510
30:24.350 --> 30:26.480
How is she doing now?

511
30:28.110 --> 30:29.590
She's actually doing quite well.

512
30:29.590 --> 30:30.400
Don't worry.

513
30:34.350 --> 30:35.160
That's good.

514
30:38.720 --> 30:40.510
You need to give her more time,

515
30:40.590 --> 30:41.550
okay?

516
30:42.440 --> 30:43.830
I came here today for two reasons.

517
30:43.830 --> 30:44.390
First,

518
30:44.410 --> 30:45.680
to tell you about the house.

519
30:45.680 --> 30:46.510
Second,

520
30:47.030 --> 30:48.240
to thank you.

521
30:48.590 --> 30:50.400
If you hadn't encouraged me

522
30:50.400 --> 30:51.640
before you left,

523
30:52.270 --> 30:53.470
your sister and I

524
30:54.920 --> 30:56.250
wouldn't have gotten together

525
30:56.250 --> 30:57.410
so soon.

526
30:57.790 --> 30:58.590
Well,

527
30:58.720 --> 31:00.590
your sister and I have been through

528
31:00.590 --> 31:02.590
so many ups and downs

529
31:02.750 --> 31:04.270
at home and in the plant.

530
31:04.640 --> 31:07.040
Now that things have finally settled down,

531
31:07.070 --> 31:08.450
I want

532
31:08.750 --> 31:10.480
to give her

533
31:11.550 --> 31:13.630
a proper wedding ceremony.

534
31:13.750 --> 31:14.570
I think

535
31:14.590 --> 31:15.910
she'll be thrilled.

536
31:18.680 --> 31:19.440
Yeah.

537
31:20.880 --> 31:22.540
She will definitely be happy.

538
31:24.960 --> 31:26.890
That's very thoughtful of you, Mo.

539
31:27.720 --> 31:28.500
I've been thinking

540
31:28.500 --> 31:30.300
that you're the key to this.

541
31:30.590 --> 31:31.440
I know neither of you

542
31:31.440 --> 31:32.970
wanted things

543
31:33.480 --> 31:35.350
to turn out this way.

544
31:36.550 --> 31:38.490
But I know your sister now.

545
31:38.550 --> 31:39.830
You're the one

546
31:40.200 --> 31:41.550
she's always been

547
31:41.550 --> 31:42.680
worried about.

548
31:44.440 --> 31:45.440
So I was thinking,

549
31:45.640 --> 31:46.880
if you could come

550
31:47.440 --> 31:48.720
to our wedding,

551
31:48.830 --> 31:49.510
firstly,

552
31:50.160 --> 31:52.020
it would be a great support for me.

553
31:52.070 --> 31:53.330
And secondly, your sister

554
31:53.330 --> 31:54.430
would feel much more at ease

555
31:54.430 --> 31:55.560
and be really happy.

556
31:55.750 --> 31:57.270
It'd also be a way of giving us

557
31:57.270 --> 31:58.740
your blessing.

558
31:58.830 --> 31:59.830
What do you think?

559
32:03.110 --> 32:04.770
When are you getting married?

560
32:06.310 --> 32:07.240
Tomorrow,

561
32:08.110 --> 32:10.000
at the plant cafeteria.

562
32:17.270 --> 32:18.600
I'll be there tomorrow.

563
32:20.640 --> 32:21.440
Great.

564
32:22.030 --> 32:23.090
Then it's perfect.

565
32:23.280 --> 32:24.310
I just wanted to tell you this.

566
32:24.310 --> 32:25.440
I'll go prepare now.

567
32:25.880 --> 32:26.400
Okay.

568
32:26.720 --> 32:27.580
Come tomorrow.

569
32:30.040 --> 32:30.690
Director Qi.

570
32:30.690 --> 32:31.450
Yiming.

571
32:31.750 --> 32:32.950
What brings you here?

572
32:33.200 --> 32:34.200
I came to see Shan.

573
32:35.400 --> 32:37.400
How... is your injury?

574
32:38.830 --> 32:39.830
I'm much better.

575
32:39.830 --> 32:40.680
Thank you, Director.

576
32:40.680 --> 32:41.440
Rest well,

577
32:41.440 --> 32:43.900
and come back to work when you've recovered.

578
32:44.960 --> 32:45.750
I'm leaving.

579
32:45.920 --> 32:48.580
Let the organization know if you need anything.

580
34:03.110 --> 34:04.740
Time to eat. Time to eat!

581
34:04.870 --> 34:06.830
Look at what delicious food my dad made.

582
34:06.830 --> 34:08.699
Authentic Chen Fu noodles.

583
34:08.760 --> 34:09.510
Smells so good.

584
34:09.510 --> 34:10.880
Is it the Sichuan pepper I bought?

585
34:10.880 --> 34:11.909
Yes.

586
34:12.150 --> 34:13.480
This Sichuan pepper has a really authentic flavor.

587
34:13.480 --> 34:15.050
Buy it from the same shop next time.

588
34:15.050 --> 34:16.909
Okay, bring my son's noodles now.

589
34:17.150 --> 34:18.920
His class won't end for a few more minutes.

590
34:18.920 --> 34:19.880
I'll cook his noodles when he gets back.

591
34:19.880 --> 34:21.400
Otherwise, they'll get soggy.

592
34:21.400 --> 34:22.230
There are two more dishes.

593
34:22.230 --> 34:23.300
You guys eat first.

594
34:24.030 --> 34:25.489
Food's best when it's hot.

595
34:26.480 --> 34:27.280
Smells so good.

596
34:27.280 --> 34:27.840
Right?

597
34:27.840 --> 34:28.380
Yes.

598
34:28.670 --> 34:30.989
So delicious!

599
35:08.550 --> 35:10.660
Yiming, time to eat.

600
35:14.070 --> 35:15.480
Here, have a bun.

601
35:19.800 --> 35:20.720
Mom.

602
35:21.150 --> 35:23.210
I need to talk to you about something.

603
35:23.480 --> 35:25.190
I'm thinking of changing jobs.

604
35:25.190 --> 35:27.520
I'm planning to go to Guangdong with Shan.

605
35:27.960 --> 35:29.710
Wait. Why?

606
35:30.030 --> 35:31.360
Shan got a job offer

607
35:31.360 --> 35:32.430
from Guangdong Petrochemical.

608
35:32.430 --> 35:34.290
I want to go with him to try my luck.

609
35:34.360 --> 35:35.190
No.

610
35:35.480 --> 35:37.000
Isn't it nice here?

611
35:37.000 --> 35:38.730
Why go all the way to Guangdong?

612
35:40.030 --> 35:42.150
What's so nice about staying here, Mom?

613
35:42.150 --> 35:43.880
You don't know what's going on.

614
35:45.760 --> 35:46.320
Mom.

615
35:48.150 --> 35:49.550
Let me tell you the truth.

616
35:49.630 --> 35:51.040
Don't you think all the things that have happened lately

617
35:51.040 --> 35:52.030
are suspicious?

618
35:52.400 --> 35:53.960
Boss died because of me.

619
35:54.030 --> 35:55.050
When Shan and Ying

620
35:55.080 --> 35:56.810
were investigating his death,

621
35:57.190 --> 35:58.400
Mrs. Zhang suddenly killed herself

622
35:58.400 --> 35:59.230
for no apparent reason.

623
35:59.230 --> 36:00.400
Now, these two siblings

624
36:00.400 --> 36:01.400
have fallen out

625
36:01.400 --> 36:02.550
for some unknown reason.

626
36:02.550 --> 36:03.800
Sun Jie was arrested.

627
36:04.190 --> 36:05.920
Wan Yang jumped off a building.

628
36:06.190 --> 36:07.280
But do you really think they can arrest

629
36:07.280 --> 36:08.410
everyone involved?

630
36:08.880 --> 36:10.630
If anything happens to Shan,

631
36:11.440 --> 36:13.100
how am I supposed to face Boss?

632
36:13.360 --> 36:14.360
Are you saying...

633
36:14.400 --> 36:15.730
Shan is in danger?

634
36:17.230 --> 36:18.510
That's why I've been trying to persuade him

635
36:18.510 --> 36:19.880
to leave Wugang as soon as possible.

636
36:19.880 --> 36:20.230
So...

637
36:20.280 --> 36:21.800
when are you leaving?

638
36:22.710 --> 36:24.640
We're planning to leave tomorrow.

639
36:26.440 --> 36:27.230
Tomorrow?

640
36:28.480 --> 36:29.920
So Shan will leave

641
36:29.920 --> 36:31.920
after his sister's wedding.

642
36:33.800 --> 36:34.880
Wedding?

643
36:35.960 --> 36:37.160
Who is Ying marrying?

644
36:37.400 --> 36:38.440
Director Qi.

645
36:40.190 --> 36:41.770
Ying is marrying Qi Mo?

646
36:42.480 --> 36:43.230
When?

647
36:43.230 --> 36:44.550
It's at noon.

648
36:44.550 --> 36:45.800
Haven't you heard?

649
36:45.800 --> 36:47.600
The plant is bustling right now.

650
36:49.230 --> 36:50.030
No.

651
36:50.670 --> 36:52.330
No, no.

652
36:53.320 --> 36:55.320
Have a bun before you go!

653
36:55.480 --> 36:56.070
You...

654
36:57.480 --> 36:58.870
Drive slowly!

655
36:59.190 --> 37:00.440
Be careful!

656
37:08.400 --> 37:08.960
Dad.

657
37:13.920 --> 37:14.480
Mom.

658
37:19.230 --> 37:19.840
Ying.

659
37:21.400 --> 37:23.400
I'm proposing another toast today.

660
37:26.760 --> 37:28.000
But this time, there really is

661
37:28.000 --> 37:28.940
good news.

662
37:32.430 --> 37:33.830
Ying is getting married.

663
37:41.650 --> 37:43.450
Qi Mo is quite nice.

664
37:44.280 --> 37:45.910
He has promised me

665
37:46.590 --> 37:48.850
that he will definitely treat Ying well.

666
37:49.960 --> 37:51.320
So rest assured.

667
37:52.840 --> 37:54.400
Drink up without worrying.

668
37:58.440 --> 37:59.630
This toast...

669
38:03.320 --> 38:04.320
is to Ying.

670
38:08.510 --> 38:10.110
Let's have a drink

671
38:10.440 --> 38:11.280
with Ying.

672
38:13.440 --> 38:14.030
Dad.

673
38:16.440 --> 38:17.030
Mom.

674
38:23.000 --> 38:24.030
How come I didn't know

675
38:24.030 --> 38:25.580
you could knit sweaters?

676
38:25.670 --> 38:26.670
This... How...

677
38:26.670 --> 38:27.910
Let me see. Let me see.

678
38:33.440 --> 38:35.440
I told you not to move...

679
38:40.960 --> 38:42.230
I wish you happiness.

680
39:01.960 --> 39:02.630
Let's eat.

681
39:30.400 --> 39:31.000
Shan!

682
39:33.110 --> 39:33.760
Shan.

683
39:34.280 --> 39:35.410
There's something

684
39:35.760 --> 39:37.110
I haven't told you.

685
39:37.400 --> 39:39.190
I've thought about it for a long time.

686
39:39.190 --> 39:40.400
I must tell you.

687
39:41.710 --> 39:42.520
