692
39:51.840 --> 39:52.480
When I woke up

693
39:52.480 --> 39:53.630
in the hospital,

694
39:54.000 --> 39:55.360
I found out that Boss

695
39:55.550 --> 39:57.480
and Director Zhang were both dead.

696
39:57.590 --> 39:58.880
I was terrified.

697
39:59.990 --> 40:01.880
Designers don't usually need to be

698
40:01.880 --> 40:03.520
