706
40:14.550 --> 40:15.230
Shan,

707
40:16.030 --> 40:17.960
Qi Mo is going to marry your sister.

708
40:18.320 --> 40:19.710
No matter what,

709
40:20.190 --> 40:21.030
I feel I have to tell you

710
40:21.030 --> 40:21.760
