724
40:57.510 --> 40:58.190
Eat up, guys.

725
40:58.190 --> 40:59.490
Eat up.

726
41:00.400 --> 41:01.360
Congratulations.

727
41:01.360 --> 41:02.230
Thank you.

728
41:02.290 --> 41:03.260
Thank you.

729
41:03.290 --> 41:04.630
Okay, thank you. Thank you.

730
41:04.630 --> 41:05.440
Eat up.

731
41:05.440 --> 41:06.630
