732
41:06.630 --> 41:08.110
Director, congratulations.

733
41:08.110 --> 41:09.110
Congratulations.

734
41:09.110 --> 41:09.510
Thank you.

735
41:09.510 --> 41:10.960
Right away.

736
41:10.160 --> 41:16.250
