767
43:06.920 --> 43:09.070
Marry him! Marry him! Marry him!

768
43:12.280 --> 43:14.740
Marry him! Marry him! Marry him!

769
43:14.770 --> 43:17.860
Marry him! Marry him! Marry him!

770
43:17.860 --> 43:20.720
Marry him! Marry him! Marry him!

771
43:20.720 --> 43:23.900
Marry him! Marry him! Marry him!

772
43:29.400 --> 43:30.400
